        "description": "CHAOS-3900 W1 (codex round 7): mirrors RequestedEvidenceWindow's own completeness guard -- the anyOf above proves at least one of relative_id/start+end is present but does not forbid a partial bound alongside a relative_id. See RequestedEvidenceWindow's identical clause for the full explanation.",
